        "TileImage": "$($repository 24ea2145-cd9a-4339-a837-26d482bf356d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYour targets are five individuals bound together by one buried political murder. The killer, the one who ordered it, the silent witness, the accomplice, and the priest who concealed their sins. Now, they gather in Sapienza, desperate to preserve the truth they stained with blood.\r\rIn 8 minutes and 8 seconds—a symbol of their endless cycle—you will bring it to an end. \r\rWhat appears to the world as senseless brutality will, in reality, be long-overdue justice.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
